AltoRewardsDistributor::revokeAdapter
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when adapter is not in whitelist
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when adapter is in whitelist
        ├── it should remove adapter from whitelist
        ├── it should maintain array integrity (swap with last element)
        └── it should emit RevokeAdapter event
